  "description": "Provides lightweight, embedded database support through SQLite for TuanZi applications, featuring:\n\t\t\t- Full Entity Framework Core SQLite provider integration\n\t\t\t- Zero-configuration, file-based database support\n\t\t\t- Cross-platform compatibility (Windows/Linux/macOS)\n\t\t\t- Transaction support with ACID compliance\n\t\t\t- Efficient resource utilization for mobile and desktop apps\n\t\t\t- Migration and schema management capabilities\n\t\t\t- Seamless integration with TuanZi's data access patterns",
